  "meta": {
    "description": "Moreira & Muir's volatility-managed market portfolio without leverage. At each month-end, hold SPY at weight min(1, c/RV), where RV is the month's realized variance of daily SPY excess returns and c is recalibrated each month on all earlier months so the uncapped rule has buy-and-hold's volatility; the rest goes to T-bills (BIL).",
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Moreira, A. & Muir, T. (2017), Volatility-Managed Portfolios, Journal of Finance 72(4), 1611-1644; NBER Working Paper 22208 (2016)",
